Description: NEXUS Arsenal profile - Network Security
 A toolkit for assessing networks you are authorized to test: port and service
 scanning, host discovery, SMB/SNMP/DNS enumeration, packet capture and
 analysis, traffic generation and bandwidth monitoring. Pairs well with the
 Sniffing and Spoofing tools and underpins both the Red Team and Blue Team
 profiles.
 .
 This metapackage recommends the 26 tools of the profile, all from Debian
 main; APT installs them with it. A tool can be removed again without removing
 the profile.
 .
 These tools are for authorised security testing, research, defence and
 education only: use them on systems you own or have explicit written
 permission to test, and follow the law that applies to you. They come with no
 warranty.

