Description: NEXUS Arsenal profile - Blue Team
 Tools for defenders and system owners: network and host intrusion detection,
 file-integrity and rootkit checks, log analysis, security auditing and
 benchmarking, sandboxing and firewalls. All are open-source packages from
 Debian; they help you watch, harden and audit systems you administer.
 .
 This metapackage recommends the 20 tools of the profile, all from Debian
 main; APT installs them with it. A tool can be removed again without removing
 the profile.
 .
 Not included, because they are not in Debian main: Zeek, Wazuh, Velociraptor,
 Elastic Stack (ELK). The Arsenal manager lists where their vendors publish
 them.
 .
 These tools are for authorised security testing, research, defence and
 education only: use them on systems you own or have explicit written
 permission to test, and follow the law that applies to you. They come with no
 warranty.

