 A software-development and secure-coding toolkit: toolchains for C/C++,
 Python, Go and Rust, build systems and debuggers, static analysers and secret
 scanners, container and virtualization tools, and editors. Aimed at
 developers building and reviewing software securely on NEXUS OS.
 .
 This metapackage recommends the 25 tools of the profile, all from Debian
